Subject: Backport libxml2 2.12-2.15, ICU 68+/70+, and C++17 register compatibility fixes to PHP 5.6
Policy-Class: P2-Package
Rationale: Backport upstream PHP libxml2 2.12-2.14 fixes (const xmlError *, libxml/parser.h, xmlsave.h/encoding.h, ATTRIBUTE_UNUSED removal, xmlBufferContent()), ICU 68+/70+ fixes (true/false booleans across ext/intl and CodePointBreakIterator::operator== bool return type), and drop C++17-forbidden register qualifiers from shared headers so PHP 5.6 builds cleanly against libxml2 2.15, ICU 79, and Clang 20.
Upstream-Status: Backport (upstream PHP 7.4/8.x libxml2 2.12-2.14 and ICU 68+/70+ compatibility fixes)
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: none
Origin-Kind: backport
Origin-Project: php/php-src

